        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type alongside an adorable pixel-art friend in this  cozy desktop overlay game.</strong><br>Whether you're grinding your typing speed, enjoying the aesthetic, or trying to stay productive, this game turns your everyday computer use into a cute motivating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play directly <strong>on top of your desktop or workflow</strong> with a fully customizable borderless overlay, just like having a tiny typing companion sitting on your screen. Every word you type makes the cat go wild on the keyboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Companion </strong>– A lively 2D pixel-art kitty  who types with you, reacts to your speed, and celebrates your best moments with rewards while you do your work! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.poster.avif?t=1766094312\" width=782 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.webm?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.mp4?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve Your WPM</strong> – Type words, train your accuracy, and chase high-score streaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ac094600f49b4128e1aba093fec4fc35.poster.avif?t=1766094312\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ac094600f49b4128e1aba093fec4fc35.webm?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ac094600f49b4128e1aba093fec4fc35.mp4?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cute Visual Effects</strong> – themes and colors that respond to your typing pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/a69d088311a3f78149bc69dbed6ccf62.poster.avif?t=1766094312\" width=780 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/a69d088311a3f78149bc69dbed6ccf62.webm?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/a69d088311a3f78149bc69dbed6ccf62.mp4?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Type alongside an adorable pixel-art friend in this  cozy desktop overlay game.</strong><br>Whether you're grinding your typing speed, enjoying the aesthetic, or trying to stay productive, this game turns your everyday computer use into a cute motivating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play directly <strong>on top of your desktop or workflow</strong> with a fully customizable borderless overlay, just like having a tiny typing companion sitting on your screen. Every word you type makes the cat go wild on the keyboard!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Typing Companion </strong>– A lively 2D pixel-art kitty  who types with you, reacts to your speed, and celebrates your best moments with rewards while you do your work! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.poster.avif?t=1766094312\" width=782 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.webm?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ce22c6be5a5194e7026dd1d4431cccea.mp4?t=1766094312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improve Your WPM</strong> – Type words, train your accuracy, and chase high-score streaks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4222650/extras/ac094600f49b4128e1aba093fec4fc35.poster.avif?t=1766094312\" width=800 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app